Tiny BIDS fixture for BIDSvue's E2E suite.

Used by tests/e2e/specs/happy-path.e2e.ts via the BIDSVUE_TEST_OPEN_DATASET
env var bypass (see src-tauri/src/lib.rs::test_open_dataset). The .nii.gz
files are intentionally empty; the scanner doesn't read file bytes and the
M3 validator phase will either accept the placeholder errors or replace
the files with real NIfTI-1 headers at that point.
